Security X-ray demo · 《安检口的夜班》 Night Shift at Lane 3 · third-party assets and sources

## Voice
- Kokoro-82M (hexgrad), voice af_heart, Apache License 2.0; run locally via kokoro-onnx (MIT) through the
  library's core/tts/tts.py. Speech check: faster-whisper small.en (MIT; OpenAI Whisper weights, MIT).
  Script: demo/voice/lines.json.

## Music samples (CC0; credit not required, given with thanks)
- VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios)
  Instruments: bass_drum, bassoon_stac, cellos, cellos_pizz, cellos_spic, contrabass, contrabass_pizz, glockenspiel,
  harp, hihat, marimba, timpani, trombone, trombone_stac, tuba_stac, vibraphone, vibraphone_bowed, violas, violins,
  violins_pizz, violins_trem, woodblock, xylophone (core/audio/sampler.py). Console tones and foley are procedural
  (core/audio/sfx.py and demo/audio.py).

## Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1; licence texts in demo/fonts/)
- IBM Plex Mono Regular / Medium: IBM, https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/ibmplexmono
- Noto Sans SC 500 / 700: Google / Adobe, https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notosanssc
