## Code
- three.js r170 (MIT), with RoundedBoxGeometry from its examples: loaded from the library's node_modules

## Images, models
- None. Every object is built in code; no photographs, no external models, no AI-generated images.

## Facts
- Every rule on screen and every factual voice line is sourced in demo/FACTS.md (CAAC notices, CAAC news site,
  China Eastern via 极目新闻), with URLs and quoted wording.
- Invented for the film: the lane, the times, the counter (1,284 bags, 37 opened, 412 power banks, 29 liquids,
  6 crabs), the bag contents, the power bank label and the console. No real company, product or logo appears.
